WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.401
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.636
We hope you're doing well

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.338
and we're going
to just get to the news.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:08.041
Ukrainian
President Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.543
delivered a virtual address
to Congress this morning

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.645
and received a standing ovation,

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:16.015
making him the first comedian
to actually deserve one.

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.917
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:20.119
Zelenskyy also called
on President Biden

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:22.288
"to be the leader of the world"
and said,

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.890
"being the leader of the world

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.625
means being the leader
of peace,"

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.927
whereas being the leader
of the world

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.395
during the Trump years meant

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:30.797
being Angela Merkel.

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.732
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:34.934
Second gentleman Doug Emhoff

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.570
tested positive yesterday
for COVID-19.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:38.671
You guessed it --

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:39.972 line:0%
Phish concert.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:42.508 line:0%
[ Laughter and cheering ]

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:44.410
Former President Trump said,
in a new interview,

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:45.845
that he was surprised

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:48.414
when Russian President
Vladimir Putin invaded Ukraine.

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:51.951
Really? 'Cause he invaded
Ukraine in 2014.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:55.254
When you're surprised by a thing
that's already happened,

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:56.389
that's a symptom.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.258
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:02.829
"Well, you finally came
to see your old grandpa."

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:04.196
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.196 --> 00:01:06.065
I was here yesterday.

00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:07.199
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.199 --> 00:01:09.369
"You're as rude as the fella
from yesterday!"

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:11.370
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:14.974
Ohio Governor Mike DeWine
signed a bill into law this week

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.676
that allows gun owners to carry

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.877
concealed weapons
without a special permit.

00:01:18.877 --> 00:01:21.547
Well, what could possibly
go off?

00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:24.417
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.355
President Biden signed
a funding bill yesterday

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.657
to keep the federal government
running through September.

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:34.027
It was either that
or take a summer job.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:36.662
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:38.864
He would love that.

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:40.766
The Senate
passed a bill yesterday

00:01:40.766 --> 00:01:44.003
that would make Daylight Saving
Time permanent across the U.S.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:47.072
Finally, a rare victory
for your oven clock.

00:01:47.072 --> 00:01:51.010
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:54.614
A man in the UK who was recently
arrested for driving recklessly

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:56.916
gave authorities a LEGOLAND ID

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.652
[ Laughter ]
when they asked
for documentation.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.688
They then charged him
with resisting arrest,

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:03.490
when he refused to get
out of the vehicle.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:04.691
"I can't!

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:05.657
I'm snapped in!"

00:02:05.657 --> 00:02:08.728
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:12.598
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:02:12.598 --> 00:02:14.266
and West Virginia
Senator Joe Manchin

00:02:14.266 --> 00:02:16.836
reportedly had a secret dinner
last month

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:18.738
at an Italian restaurant
on Capitol Hill

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:21.241
to help repair
their strained relationship.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:23.509
And I think it might be working.

00:02:23.509 --> 00:02:26.446
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:30.316
According to a new survey,
55% of pet owners said

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:33.386
that their dog experiencing
separation anxiety

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:36.355
is their biggest concern
about returning to the office.

00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:37.856
"Kids'll be fine, though.

00:02:37.856 --> 00:02:40.759
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:40.759 --> 00:02:42.195
They got each other."

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:43.763
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:44.997
In a new interview,

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:47.066
Rolling Stones guitarist
Keith Richards said

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:49.368
that he quit smoking cigarettes
two years ago.

00:02:49.368 --> 00:02:51.871
And if you're wondering
how bad his habit got,

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.506
he's 39.

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:56.609
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:59.578
And, finally,
according to a new study,

00:02:59.578 --> 00:03:01.581
older adults who walk

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:04.183
between 6,000
and 8,000 steps a day

00:03:04.183 --> 00:03:06.685
are 50% less likely to die early

00:03:06.685 --> 00:03:10.556
and 50% more likely to be lost
in a parking garage.

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:11.757
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.757 --> 00:03:12.892
"Where is it, Harold?!"

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:14.694
I don't know, Helen!

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:16.395
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.395 --> 00:03:17.897
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

